WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.000
The second target. What happens when two signals arrive too close together?

00:00:06.000 --> 00:00:12.000
First target: report one target in a rapid stream of symbols.

00:00:12.000 --> 00:00:18.000
Second target: it may be missed at some short delays, under specific conditions.

00:00:18.000 --> 00:00:24.000
Exceptions matter. When targets arrive back-to-back, the second may be spared.

00:00:24.000 --> 00:00:30.000
Training is not a product test. Intensive meditation research did not test retail audio.

00:00:30.000 --> 00:00:36.000
Zen12 advertises 12 levels and 48 MP3 recordings. Contents are not proof of efficacy.

00:00:36.000 --> 00:00:42.000
Read the evidence. Consider free practice. Then evaluate offers.
